{"schema":"asx.scenario.v2","id":"supervision-shutdown-budget-bounds-the-drained-cleanup-001","description":"A one_for_all supervisor drains its siblings when c.x fails. c.y carries shutdown_budget poll_quota 17 and c.z the default (Budget::INFINITE): the drain cancels each generation's region with that ceiling (ChildSpec::with_shutdown_budget, supervision.rs:680, :2235), so the cancel-oblivious worker in c.y's generation is left with a cleanup budget of 17 polls where User grants 1000, and c.z's keeps User's 1000 at priority 200.","unit":"supervision","rules":["rule.cancel.request","def.cancel.reason_kinds","rule.region.close_cancel_children"],"seed":42,"lab":{"max_steps":5000},"regions":[{"name":"r.main","parent":"root","budget":null}],"channels":[],"sync":[{"name":"n.never","type":"notify"}],"tasks":[{"name":"t.owner","region":"r.main","budget":null,"program":[{"op":"supervise","as":"sup.x","policy":"one_for_all","max_restarts":1,"window_ns":60000000000,"children":[{"name":"c.x","mode":"permanent","program":[{"op":"sleep","ns":1000000},{"op":"return","outcome":{"tag":"err","status":"ASX_E_INVALID_STATE"}}]},{"name":"c.y","mode":"permanent","shutdown_budget":{"poll_quota":17},"program":[{"op":"spawn","as":"w","program":[{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n.never"}]},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n.never"}]},{"name":"c.z","mode":"permanent","program":[{"op":"spawn","as":"w","program":[{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n.never"}]},{"op":"notify_wait","notify":"n.never"}]}]},{"op":"supervisor_join","supervisor":"sup.x"}]}],"script":[],"expect":{"kind":"ok"}}
